00:07:54.020 --> 00:07:59.700
disclosed in the fine print rather than emerging as sudden revelations. The mechanism is straightforward

00:07:59.700 --> 00:08:04.700
commercial television networks pay for compelling content talent receive significant sums relative

00:08:04.700 --> 00:08:09.500
to normal earnings and both sides accept that the edited version may differ from lived experience.

00:08:10.220 --> 00:08:15.980
